{"is_error":false,"duration_api_ms":26833,"num_turns":2,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"81a15c8a-b17b-51d0-843d-29f6c4846b53","total_cost_usd":0.28693799999999997,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8654,"cache_read_input_tokens":905,"output_tokens":2153,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8654,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2153,"cache_read_input_tokens":905,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8654,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8654},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5213,"outputTokens":14,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0052829999999999995,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty"},"claude-fable-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":2153,"cacheReadInputTokens":905,"cacheCreationInputTokens":8654,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.281655,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-fable-5","provider":"firstParty"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"declaration_consistent\":true,\"selected_report_demonstration\":\"absence\",\"lock_follows_declaration\":true,\"reasons\":[\"Declaration says one row per overnight session with tank_id as the independent unit; the frozen CSV has 46 rows over exactly 12 tanks, each tank appearing 3-4 times with diet constant within tank, and both arms carry 6 tanks (control: T01,T03,T05,T07,T09,T11; bglucan: T02,T04,T06,T08,T10,T12), so the declaration is consistent with the data in both procedure arms.\",\"The report demonstrates absence of the issue: it states the 46 rows are repeated sessions, shows a tank-level table whose session counts (4,4,4,4,3,4,4,4,4,3,4,4) sum to 46, and runs the Mann-Whitney on 12 tank means (6 vs 6), never on session rows.\",\"Recomputation confirms tank-level analysis: tank means match the raw data (e.g., T05 = 219.30 from 3 sessions, T10 = 233.10 from 3 sessions), U = 34 matches the ranking of the 12 tank means, exact two-sided p = 8/924 = 0.008658, and rank-biserial = 2*34/(6*6) - 1 = 0.889, all as reported; these values are only attainable with n = 6 per group, not with row-level n.\",\"The minted lock authorizes key columns [\\\"tank_id\\\"], exactly the declared independent-unit column, scoped to this case, input digest, and the mannwhitneyu procedure, so the unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone.\"]}","structured_output":{"declaration_consistent":true,"selected_report_demonstration":"absence","lock_follows_declaration":true,"reasons":["Declaration says one row per overnight session with tank_id as the independent unit; the frozen CSV has 46 rows over exactly 12 tanks, each tank appearing 3-4 times with diet constant within tank, and both arms carry 6 tanks (control: T01,T03,T05,T07,T09,T11; bglucan: T02,T04,T06,T08,T10,T12), so the declaration is consistent with the data in both procedure arms.","The report demonstrates absence of the issue: it states the 46 rows are repeated sessions, shows a tank-level table whose session counts (4,4,4,4,3,4,4,4,4,3,4,4) sum to 46, and runs the Mann-Whitney on 12 tank means (6 vs 6), never on session rows.","Recomputation confirms tank-level analysis: tank means match the raw data (e.g., T05 = 219.30 from 3 sessions, T10 = 233.10 from 3 sessions), U = 34 matches the ranking of the 12 tank means, exact two-sided p = 8/924 = 0.008658, and rank-biserial = 2*34/(6*6) - 1 = 0.889, all as reported; these values are only attainable with n = 6 per group, not with row-level n.","The minted lock authorizes key columns [\"tank_id\"], exactly the declared independent-unit column, scoped to this case, input digest, and the mannwhitneyu procedure, so the unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone."]},"ttft_ms":12344,"ttft_stream_ms":1553,"time_to_request_ms":14,"type":"result","duration_ms":25782,"uuid":"b7f7e9e9-9f2b-47d8-ac2b-d315ebf8fbd8"}
